<title>USA: Sedgwick Cty PBC, Kan., $16.700 mln won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Sedgwick Cty PBC, Kan., $16.700 mln won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it won $16.700 million of Sedgwick Cty Public Bldg. Commission, Kan., lease rental revenue bonds, Series A, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.12 percent.</p>
</text>
